+
+Every call is one Case keyed by the external id field in the mapping (AV_Call_Id__c), so
+PATCH /sobjects/Case/AV_Call_Id__c/{call_id} creates it the first time and updates it after.
+Notes are FeedItems on the Case. Auth is an OAuth access token from the platform secret store;
+token refresh is the deployer's integration user setup [CD].
